AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://doi.org/10.1351/goldbook.S05762") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5985-7429") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MOP_0000618> "A molecular process where a molecule is broken up by reaction with a molecule that is part of the solvent material. It may be the primary constituent molecule of the solvent material (for example water, ethanol, ammonia) or its lyonium ion or lyate ion.")
